WEBVTT

00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:12.700
Yes, thank you.

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:15.030
Excuse me.

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:19.200
Thank goodness.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.410
Did he accept your resubmission?

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:22.410
Yeah.

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:27.590
He gave me a long scolding, then sighed and said, "I'm worried about your future."

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:29.300
Well, yeah.

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:29.920
Here.

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:31.300
Thanks.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:36.890
We couldn't go out because of you, <i>and</i> you almost flunked out.

00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:38.810
You need to learn from this.

00:00:38.810 --> 00:00:40.720
I know, I'm sorry.

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:44.350
Sometimes you're in a weird mood.

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:45.900
You need to watch out.

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:47.440
You don't plan for the future enough.

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:50.610
Wait, look who's talking.

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:57.870
You know, you still haven't paid me back the 7,000 yen you borrowed last year.

00:00:57.870 --> 00:01:01.790
Well, this month is not a good time for...

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:02.830
like the Valentine's Day...

00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:04.620
It was a free coupon!
like the Valentine's Day...

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:06.580
You got it from Saku-chan!

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:11.420
And you haven't lost the weight you gained over New Year's, have you, Yuki-chan?

00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:16.760
It's because my club was on break due to exams, and...

00:01:17.550 --> 00:01:22.470
Oh, I noticed you have more dolls on your desk.

00:01:22.470 --> 00:01:24.680
Are you wasting money again?

00:01:24.680 --> 00:01:28.810
A-An underclassman in my club gave me those.

00:01:35.110 --> 00:01:36.070
Here.

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:40.240
You haven't lost the weight you gained either, have you?

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:44.290
Sorry, I lied.

00:01:44.290 --> 00:01:45.200
I bought them.

00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:48.120
I'm glad you're honest.

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:51.710
I'll pay you back the next time we get our allowance.

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:58.300
You can pay me back anytime it's convenient for you.

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:12.730
Anyway, now that I'm done with my reworks,

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:16.060
let's go out together this Sunday.

00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:17.360
Yeah!

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:19.530
Going out with Kana-chan!

00:02:19.530 --> 00:02:23.700
First, we'll buy something for Saku-chan in return.

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:26.410
Is there anywhere you want to go, Yuki-chan?

00:02:27.410 --> 00:02:30.880
Not really. I don't care as long as I'm with you.

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:34.920
Oh! Let's go get boxes.

00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:37.170
Boxes?

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:41.300
Oh yeah, I forgot.

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:44.890
But we can ask the grocery store downstairs for some.

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:46.350
Oh, right.

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:52.400
In that case, they just started selling that pillow that you can drop an egg on from the fifth floor and...

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:58.030
It seems you haven't learned your lesson at all, so can you pay me back as soon as possible, Yuki-chan?

00:02:58.030 --> 00:03:00.070
You said anytime is fine!

00:03:00.070 --> 00:03:02.700
Sorry, I lied.
You said anytime is fine!

00:03:17.050 --> 00:03:21.090
Still a single, but there's enough room for two people.

00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:23.930
We get two normal beds this time?

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:24.800
Bummer.

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:28.270
The only place we can find bunk beds are old dorms,

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:31.440
or rooms that were forcibly made into two-person rooms like yours.

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:34.770
So it was an unintended design.

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:37.320
Anyway, Saku-chan...

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:38.320
Yes?

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:44.030
I see a room number on the huge room on the top floor...

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:46.620
Are you telling me...

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:47.830
Yes, of course!

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:54.500
It's the love nest—I mean, the new home for you and I!

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:57.550
Our new life starts this spring.

00:03:57.550 --> 00:03:59.010
"Welcome home, Senpai."

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:01.170
"Would you like a bath, me,"

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:02.970
"or... me?"

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:03.800
That didn't sound right.

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:05.890
We would look at the night view from the balcony, and...

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:08.180
"Night view"? But that place is a residential area.
"Senpai, I'm getting sleepy."

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:09.640
"Shall we?"

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:11.390
And we move to the king-sized bed together.

00:04:11.390 --> 00:04:13.440
Wait, why is there only one bed?

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:16.520
Oh, I prepared a private room for you, Yukino-senpai.

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:18.360
But you can join us too if you'd like.

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:20.530
I don't mind being watched.

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:25.030
So, please give me your stamp, Kanade-senpai!

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:25.360
Hold it, why is my name on that form already?

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:28.620
Go ahead and stamp it!

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:29.200
Hold it, why is my name on that form already?

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:31.500
Besides, we already submitted ours.

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:34.920
Um...

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:37.460
Don't they start accepting these tomorrow?

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:41.840
Only for the new residents, right?

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:45.260
It's because the new freshmen didn't know if they were accepted or not until now.

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:46.050
Yup.

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:49.890
We're only moving to a different room, so we turned in our application in January.

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:53.140
Um, hello, Saku-chan?

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:55.810
She's totally bummed out.

00:04:55.810 --> 00:05:01.030
Her family built the place, but she didn't know about the application due date?

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:03.610
I sympathize with her a little, but I'm seriously glad we finished ours earlier.

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:05.570
Senpai... Stamp...

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:09.030
I didn't expect her scheme to be this bold, though.

00:05:10.030 --> 00:05:12.660
But I'm a bit curious to see what this room is like.

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:15.040
Then we can go check it out once we move.

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:18.170
Actually, it sounds scary, so I won't.

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:19.790
Shoot! Gotta head to class!

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:20.670
What about you, Yuki-chan?

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:22.590
Mine's this way.

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:25.130
Okay, then see you later.

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:26.010
Yeah.

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:37.020
Sheesh! Come on, Saku-chan.

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:39.310
Do you need to go to your homeroom?

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:41.770
No, your stamp, Senpai.

00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:44.360
Like I said...

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:45.860
Stamp...

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:51.120
And she was spaced out the whole time.

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:57.000
Well sure.  She made such an elaborate plan and it didn't work, so I know how she must be feeling, but...

00:05:58.040 --> 00:06:02.920
She was just floating like a jellyfish and not really swimming.

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:06.670
It wasn't safe that way, so we sent her home early.

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:12.560
Her best shot missed, and she got annihilated by a critical hit instead...

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:18.020
Why do I feel guilty despite the fact that I only defended myself?

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:23.520
Well, knowing Saku-chan, I'm sure she'll be fine by tomorrow.

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:28.200
But to make sure, I'll send a new photo of you as a cheer-up aid...

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:30.950
Yuki-chan...

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:37.710
Oh yeah, Shi-chan wrote me an e-mail asking when we're coming home for spring break.

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:42.170
Um, Yuki-chan,

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:48.050
our teacher's also going to be at school during spring break,

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:53.510
so I want to work at school during the break, so...

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:57.850
Then we need to tell her we're sorry this time.

00:06:57.850 --> 00:06:59.560
Sorry, Yuki-chan.

00:07:00.350 --> 00:07:04.690
I'm fine, but let's not forget to call Shi-chan.

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:08.900
Um, what if we e-mail her...

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:11.030
Kana-chan!

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:21.580
You see, I'll be preparing for college entrance exams this year,

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:24.670
so this spring break...

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:26.090
Okay?

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:31.800
Um, can you hear me, Shizuku-chan?

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:33.260
I can.

00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:38.430
Since it won't cost money like the studio does,

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:43.560
I mean, the cram school, because I'm working with my teacher...

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:47.320
And this teacher really works with us students,

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:53.360
so if I can pass without using the studio, it'll be good for all of us, right?

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:59.040
Well, you're in a specialized field, so I guess it can't be helped.

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:00.580
I'm sorry, Shi-chan.

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:03.540
So, you'll be at school the entire break?

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:08.710
Well, I think I'll take a small break, but basically...

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:10.670
Why?

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:11.630
Never mind.

00:08:11.630 --> 00:08:15.220
Oh, I'll tell Dad and Mom about this.

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:17.600
Talk to you later, Kana-neechan.

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:20.220
Say hi to Yuki-neechan for me.

00:08:20.220 --> 00:08:21.560
Yeah.

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:23.730
Good night then, Shi-chan.

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:26.400
What did she say?

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:30.280
"It can't be helped."

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:34.320
I thought she'd complain more, but I guess...

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:36.870
She said hi to you.

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:38.200
I see.

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:41.580
I hope she's not holding back too much again.

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:44.830
I'll talk to her again some other day.

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:46.960
Yes, please, Yuki-chan.

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:53.340
Also, even though it makes me happy, you really don't have to stick around with me during the break.

00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:59.970
Since my club will still be meeting, and I'll be retiring in May, I'll do what I can now.

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:03.180
And are you sure about this?

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:04.560
What about?

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:07.480
I don't know how the art department works,

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:14.490
but wouldn't you have a better chance of getting accepted to an art college if you went to a cram school?

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:18.950
Well, yeah, since they prepare us especially for it.

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:22.240
But our teachers also do similar work for us,

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:24.790
and I'm not sure I'll be accepted on my first try,

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:28.080
so I don't want to add any more financial burden on us.

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:32.840
But if I don't pass this year, I might go to the studio while working part-time.

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:35.840
Hey, Kana-chan, Kana-chan,

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:42.560
I want to stay with you forever.

00:09:43.470 --> 00:09:48.100
Why are you repeating this again now?

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:50.310
Of course we'll be together forever.

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:54.400
We'll move on to college together,

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:56.650
we'll graduate together,

00:09:56.650 --> 00:09:58.740
and we'll get jobs together.

00:09:59.570 --> 00:10:00.370
Yeah.

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:07.460
But I'm worried about the girl who puts such a drawing on her desk.

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:10.210
Yuki-chan, you meanie.

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:12.960
You don't have to pick on me about that over and over.

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:18.760
Anyway, I think it's better if you go to a cram school.

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:22.100
But financially...

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:24.640
Then I'll find a part-time job.

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:29.690
Then you can go to cram school, and we'll work hard together.

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:33.150
Yuki-chan?

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:35.960
How does that sound, Kana-chan?

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:39.200
You crazy?
